              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1308.2231"} arXiv:1308.2231
          %p
            Claim that combining the super-embedding formalism with
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super-exceptional+generalized+geometry"} super-exceptional generalized geometry
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Perry-Schwarz+action+functional"} Perry-Schwarz-type Lagrangian
            for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            emerges as the relative trivialization of the super-cocycle of the M5-brane relative to its super-exceptional embedding:
          %ul
            %li#FSS19c
              %p
